{"schema_version":1,"resources":{"locales/jp/ep3/quest_story/13221050.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13221050","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13221050","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1322105001:1":{"text":"昨晩、ホワイトマウンテン修道院でお祈りをしていたら、修道者に助けを請う町民の話を偶然耳にしたのです。","source_cn":"昨天晚上我去白山修道院祷告，无意中听到有镇民来向修士求助。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2AD46A7E1D5A3B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1322105001":{"text":"昨晩、ホワイトマウンテン修道院でお祈りをしていたら、修道者に助けを請う町民の話を偶然耳にしたのです。","source_cn":"昨天晚上我去白山修道院祷告，无意中听到有镇民来向修士求助。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2AD46A7E1D5A3B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322105002:1":{"text":"はい……修道院にいると、女神様をより身近に感じられるので。ご安心ください、誰にも気付かれないように気を付けております。","source_cn":"嗯……在修道院里，我感觉能更靠近女神。别担心，我都是悄...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEFAD3E301B1C02D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1322105005:1":{"text":"ですが、大主教様が悪に身を堕とし、多くの修道者が亡くなってしまったことで、管理者のいない修道院は今混乱に見舞われています。とても民を救うことまで手が回りません。","source_cn":"可自从大主教恶堕，修士修女死亡，修道院就无人管理。现在...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x94DE82248A889826","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1322105006:1":{"text":"どうか修道院の様子を見に行ってくださいますか？できることなら、彼らを助けてあげていただきたいのです。","source_cn":"你们能去修