勒沙教堂应该很安全。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA306E7C10ABA5A2E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1322112005:1":{"text":"ああ、デューラ様に感謝！やはりあなた方は女神様が遣わされた使者なのですね！","source_cn":"噢，艾雅保佑！实在是太感谢了，你们果然是女神派来的使者！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86CDBA9538D53C3C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1322112006:1":{"text":"実は、ロンロンたちが来たのはカレリーナさんに頼まれたからなんです。修道院が人手不足だからって。","source_cn":"其实是卡列琳娜发觉修道院人手不足，请我们来帮忙的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86D455A1ED289E4D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1322112007:1":{"text":"カレリーナさん？町の方でしょうか？……きっととても敬虔で心優しい方なのでしょうね。彼女にデューラ様のご加護があらんことを！","source_cn":"卡列琳娜？原谅我，我实在记不得所有镇民的名字，但她一定...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7AD85E77A2B051AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1322112008:1":{"text":"今の私たちにできることは限られていますが、きっと聖堂からもさらに助っ人が来てくれるはずです。なんとか修道院を維持してみせますよ。","source_cn":"有许多事情我们现在没有力量去做，但圣堂一定会再派更多人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1AF480E6F483CF8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1322112009:1":{"text":"改めて、あなた方の協力に感謝いたします。","source_cn":"无论如何，再次感谢你们无私的帮助。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x867808F8AE356D7D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:2:0:1":{"text":"生きた屍が大勢いたよ。","source_cn":"不太好，有很多活死人","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x284E7E44BE6198CE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"生きた屍が大勢いたよ。","female":"生きた屍が大勢いたわ。","variant_male_record_index":"69436","variant_female_record_index":"69437","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1322112004:1":{"text":"屍はロンロンたちが追い払いました！","source_cn":"嘿嘿，我们把活死人都驱赶走了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B0A1F9F60E3F04B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:2:1:2":{"text":"もう大丈夫だ。","source_cn":"别担心，已经没事了","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xEEB98FC08108295D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"もう大丈夫だ。","female":"もう大丈夫よ。","variant_male_record_index":"69438","variant_female_record_index":"69439","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:修士奥格列":{"text":"修道士のオグレ","source":"修士奥格列","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"メイメイ","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"ロンロン","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":13,"localized_text_count":12,"speaker_count":3}},"locales/jp/ep3/quest_story/13221130.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13221130","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13221130","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1322113001:1":{"text":"戻られたのですね。修道院の方はどうでしたか？","source_cn":"你们回来了，修道院的情况怎么样？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB7D62684619B6EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1322113001":{"text":"戻られたのですね。修道院の方はどうでしたか？","source_cn":"你们回来了，修道院的情况怎么样？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB7D62684619B6EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322113002:1":{"text":"やはり葬儀が多すぎて人手が足りないのですね……","source_cn":"太多葬礼导致人手不足……只希望圣堂能尽快派更多的人来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x511C6FAADD2DEF61","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1322113003:1":{"text":"聖堂が一人でも多くの高位聖職者を送ってくれるといいのですが……普通の聖職者では、生きた屍に太刀打ちできませんよ……","source_cn":"唉，要是圣堂能多派一些高阶圣职者就更好了，这些活死人根...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF0F669B5112321B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1322113004:1":{"text":"たとえ新しい聖職者が来て、人々を襲う屍を食い止められたとしても、根本的な問題は消えません……","source_cn":"我还是很担心。即便新的圣职者到来之后，能够制止活死人出...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E5D3CCE2DF2952B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1322113005:1":{"text":"生きた屍に完全なる死を与えない限り、